            "caption": "Where candlelight and woodcraft meet.",
            "heading": "Our Story",
            "text": "<p>Emberwood & Hearth is a small-batch, handcrafted home goods brand built around a single belief: the spaces you come home to deserve to feel like somewhere worth being. We're a small business, founded and run by hand, rooted in natural materials, honest craft, and the art of atmosphere. Everything we make starts with wood and fire — not as a theme, but as a foundation. You'll find them woven into every product we make, every material we choose, every detail we obsess over. That's not an accident. It's the whole point.</p>",
