          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the Name",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_HhBtJm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Emberwood & Hearth isn't just a name — it's a blueprint for everything we make. Each word carries its weight, and together they describe not just what we sell, but the feeling we're after in every product we craft.</p><ul><li><strong>Ember</strong> The settled warmth of a fire that's found its rhythm. Not the roar of a flame — the quiet, steady heat that lingers and fills a room.</li><li><strong>Wood</strong> The core material running through our entire brand. In our wicks, our lids, our woodworks, our finishes, and the scents themselves. The thread that ties everything together.</li><li><strong>Hearth </strong>The home. The gathering place. The room you walk into and exhale. Everything we make is designed to live there and make it feel more like itself.</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
