    "image_banner_YT6V8i": {
      "type": "image-banner",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_hPW8YR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Wood is Everything",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_TnWFVd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "This isn't a candle brand that happens to use wood accents. Wood is the backbone of Emberwood & Hearth from the inside out — and it shows up in every single product we make. <em>From the wick that crackles to the lid that rests on top to the tray that holds it all in place — wood is present every step of the way. </em>Our candles burn on a wood wick — a thin slice of natural wood that crackles softly as it burns, exactly the way a real fire does. That sound is deliberate. It's part of the experience. Each candle is then capped with a handcrafted wood lid, cut and finished by hand from locally sourced hardwood. The lid isn't packaging — it's a piece of woodcraft in its own right.Our handcrafted woodworks extend the same material and philosophy beyond the candle itself. Locally sourced hardwoods, natural oil finishes, clean lines, and surfaces that let the grain do the talking. Our candle trays are handmade to fit our candles exactly — designed as a set, meant to be used as one.",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
