    "rich_text_Yw9weg": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_WRXYL6": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Setting the Scene",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_LxYBPN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our candle collection is built entirely around atmosphere. Every scent is named for a moment — a place, a time of day, a feeling you recognize the instant you walk into the room. Campfire in Evening. Woodshop at Night. Cabin after Rain. Mountain Trail after Dusk. These aren't just fragrance names. They're invitations to be somewhere.</p><p>You light the candle and the room shifts. The wood wick crackles. The scent fills the air. And for a moment, you're somewhere else — somewhere quieter, warmer, more your own. That's the intention behind every scent we pour.</p>"
          }
        }
