    "multirow_JrBxaU": {
      "type": "multirow",
      "blocks": {
        "row_dTThd9": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2026-04-26_at_11.34.21_AM.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Made by Hand. Every Time.",
            "text": "<p>Everything is made by hand in small batches. The candles are poured one batch at a time, carefully measured and crafted to burn cleanly and fill a room the way a fire does — slow, warm, and present. The woodworks are cut, shaped, and finished by hand. The trays are built to fit our candles. The lids are crafted to match. Nothing here is mass produced or outsourced. It's all made by us.</p><p>Small batch isn't a marketing phrase. It's how we maintain the quality and intention that makes these products worth owning. When an order leaves here, someone made it by hand. That matters to us, and we think it'll matter to you.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_gbNTbh": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "A Full Experience Brand",
            "text": "<p>Emberwood & Hearth isn't a single product — it's a complete sensory world built around wood, fire, and the atmosphere of home. The candle crackles. The wood lid sits on the jar. The tray holds it all in place. The scent fills the room and puts you somewhere specific — a back porch at dawn, a cabin after a long rain, a study with a glass of whiskey and a lamp burning low.</p><p>Every product we make is designed to be part of that world — to fit together, complement each other, and make your space feel more like the place you actually want to be. That's not a feature of what we sell. That's the whole point.</p><p>We don't chase trends. We don't do loud branding or mass production. We make things carefully, from honest materials, for the spaces worth coming home to.</p><p>That's Emberwood & Hearth. We're glad you found us.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
